OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after police stand-off led
OL,4,Ato road closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a
OL,7,Fstand-off with police led to a major
OL,8,Froad in Nottingham being closed.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Police said officers
OL,11,Fwere sent to Ilkeston Road after
OL,12,Freports a man "was in possession of a
OL,13,Fknife" at about 10:55 BST on Friday.
OL,15,FA police cordon was in place near the
OL,16,Fjunction with Balfour Road, with
OL,17,Ftraffic diverted on to neighbouring
OL,18,Froutes, before it was lifted at about
OL,19,F15:20.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
