OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after police stand-off led
OL,4,Ato road closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, the force said a
OL,7,F43-year-old man was arrested on
OL,8,Fsuspicion of affray and possessing an
OL,9,Foffensive weapon.
